      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 5,
      "text": "Step 5: Each isosceles right triangle has legs of length \\(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\) or 1. The area of one such triangle is \\(\\frac{1}{2} \\times \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4}\\) for the smaller triangles and \\(\\frac{1}{2} \\times 1^2 = \\frac{1}{2}\\) for the larger triangles.",
